    <briefdescription>
<para>Event recorded within a span&apos;s lifetime. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Span events are lightweight markers with a timestamp and optional attributes. Useful for recording lifecycle events (e.g., &quot;cache_hit&quot;, &quot;network_retry&quot;). </para>
